    "en": "x² + 2 > 0"
   },
   {
    "en": "x + y < 3"
   },
   {
    "en": "3x + 5 < 7"
   },
   {
    "en": "1/x > 2"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 2,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "3x + 5 < 7 has one variable, of degree 1. x² is degree 2, x + y has two variables, and 1/x is not linear."
  },
